full-query: "A developer asks you to help on setting up AWS CodeBuild for a new Java project. The project is built by Maven. In its buildspec.yml file,there are several phases such as install, pre_build and build. There is a requirement that if a command in a phase has failed, CodeBuild still has a chance to run some shell commands to do custom operations such as log collection. How should you configure the CodeBuild project to meet the need?"
